title: Fascination with common* joys is [valid, ?critical].
pid: eda119a2-0086-4d77-b5fd-59ae1c94f67b
body: |2-
  (*) Ones that have been expressed by others, untold times.

  If I'm bored by people talking about what they ate,
  maybe the problem is them, yes,
  but also maybe it is me.
